# ADDED FOR THE GREEN DEVOPS EXPERIMENT. Not part of the upstream project.
#
# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to .dockerignore, so
# this applies ONLY to Dockerfile.experiment and the project's own .dockerignore
# is left untouched for its own Dockerfile.
#
# The project's .dockerignore excludes dist/ and node_modules/ because its image
# builds them itself. The packaging image must do the opposite: it ships the
# artefacts the earlier pipeline stages already produced.
.git
integration_tests
test_results
helm_deploy
docker-compose*
*.md
npm-debug.log
